    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe hine to ðam andagan gelæst næbbe, læde hine to Rome ⁊ ðarto eacan þrittig p', ⁊ bringe þonne switelunge þæt he þar swa micel betæht hæbbe; ⁊ þonne he ham cume, gilde þam cyninge hundtwelftig scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who has failed to make payment by the appointed time shall take it to Rome, and 30 pence in addition thereto, and shall bring thence evidence that he has there handed over that amount; and when he comes home, he shall pay 120 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe þonne to ðam andagan gelæst næbbe, læde hine to Rome ⁊ þærto eacan XXX pænega, ⁊ bringe þonne þanon swytolinga, þæt he þær swa micel betæht hæbbe; ⁊ þonne he ham cume, gylde þam cynge hundtwelftig scill'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
